# v0.24.0 — Hub node development special (overview)

**Scope**: hub node live validation, two-node paid AI jobs, cross-island bridge multi-sig/Merkle verification, multi-key consensus, ZK/TEE gating, CLI surface cleanup, and canonical 0x migration.

**Baseline**: v0.23.34 remediation merged.

